    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Features",
      "source_hash": 16763020479604583454,
      "context_hash": 8484326889096789516,
      "translation": "특징",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:48.669573Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Comes in different variants: quark (RV32I), electron (RV32IM), intermissum (RV32IM + irq), gracilis (RV32IMC + irq), petitbateau (RV32IMFC + irq).",
      "source_hash": 6785781724856883188,
      "context_hash": 16855576083882355318,
      "translation": "quark(RV32I), electron(RV32IM), intermissum(RV32IM + irq), gracilis(RV32IMC + irq), petitbateau(RV32IMFC + irq) 등 다양한 변형으로 제공됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:48.669573Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Synthesis using the freeware tools (Yosys and nextpnr).",
      "source_hash": 2343759590406980966,
      "context_hash": 11842084990430954655,
      "translation": "무료 도구(Yosys 및 nextpnr)를 사용해 합성합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:48.669573Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Main goal: to be used for teaching, easy to read, fitting on the ICEstick, fun demos (graphics), equip students for approx. $40.",
      "source_hash": 9483833325162935825,
      "context_hash": 15851767851495816907,
      "translation": "주요 목표: 교육용으로 사용하기 위한 것으로, 읽기 쉽고, ICEstick에 들어맞으며, 재미있는 데모(그래픽)를 제공하고, 학생들에게 약 40달러로 장비를 갖춰 주는 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:48.669573Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Disclaimer: I'm no FPGA expert, please feel free to comment, to give me some advice !",
      "source_hash": 15252975409592497046,
      "context_hash": 6699556371842895643,
      "translation": "면책 조항: 저는 FPGA 전문가가 아니니, 편하게 의견을 주시거나 조언을 해 주십시오!",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "FPGA": "FPGA"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:48.669573Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Runs at 80MHz on the ICEStick and on the ULX3S.",
      "source_hash": 4446718167350752892,
      "context_hash": 3055986608567906053,
      "translation": "ICEStick와 ULX3S에서 80MHz로 동작합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:48.669574Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "6kb RAM (ICEStick) or 256kb (ULX3S)",
      "source_hash": 12077645400740875660,
      "context_hash": 11645486423449591004,
      "translation": "6kb RAM(ICEStick) 또는 256kb(ULX3S)입니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:48.669574Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "Firmware can be generated with gnu RISC-V toolsuite (script included), in C or in assembly.",
      "source_hash": 8012480745917091875,
      "context_hash": 13413346632095424326,
      "translation": "펌웨어는 gnu RISC-V 툴슈트(스크립트 포함)를 이용해 C 또는 어셈블리로 생성할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "RISC-V": "RISC-V"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:48.669574Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "SOC memory-mapped device drivers and hardware for UART, built-in LEDs, OLed display, led matrix.",
      "source_hash": 7176376274790628264,
      "context_hash": 11592161768201947207,
      "translation": "UART, 내장 LED, OLed 디스플레이, LED 매트릭스를 위한 SOC 메모리 매핑 장치 드라이버 및 하드웨어입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:48.669574Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "femtolibC, femtoGL (everything fits in 6kb).",
      "source_hash": 11582899945147370863,
      "context_hash": 12012187744410425995,
      "translation": "femtolibC, femtoGL(모든 것이 6kb 안에 들어갑니다)입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:48.669574Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "includes @ultraembedded's fat_io_lib (access to FAT filesystem on SDCards).",
      "source_hash": 14204845489837896444,
      "context_hash": 15086776134154490919,
      "translation": "@ultraembedded의 fat_io_lib(SD카드의 FAT 파일시스템 접근)을 포함합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:48.669574Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:11/seg:0",
      "source": "\"femtOS\" virtual output support: redirects printf() to UART, OLED screen (or led matrix, WIP).",
      "source_hash": 11270448865691178353,
      "context_hash": 17998570133898921416,
      "translation": "\"femtOS\" 가상 출력 지원: printf()를 UART, OLED 화면(또는 LED 매트릭스, 작업 중)으로 리디렉션합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:48.669574Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:12/seg:0",
      "source": "many RISC-V assembly and C demo programs, including graphics for the OLED display.",
      "source_hash": 17739659486217198139,
      "context_hash": 11011109613995909706,
      "translation": "OLED 디스플레이용 그래픽을 포함한 다수의 RISC-V 어셈블리 및 C 데모 프로그램입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "RISC-V": "RISC-V"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:48.669574Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:13/seg:0",
      "source": "now directly available in [LiteX](https://github.com/enjoy-digital/litex), see [tutorial](https://github.com/BrunoLevy/learn-fpga/blob/master/FemtoRV/TUTORIALS/litex.md)",
      "source_hash": 5282693790446904588,
      "context_hash": 12527756076707266152,
      "translation": "이제 [LiteX](https://github.com/enjoy-digital/litex)에서 바로 사용할 수 있습니다. [튜토리얼](https://github.com/BrunoLevy/learn-fpga/blob/master/FemtoRV/TUTORIALS/litex.md)을 참고하십시오",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:48.669574Z",
      "issues": []
    },
