    {
      "id": "section:2/block:58/seg:0",
      "source": "First column is a standard configuration for IceStick (UART and LED configured, 6Kb RAM, two-level shifter).",
      "source_hash": 6119109148596423562,
      "context_hash": 15685106814492727465,
      "translation": "첫 번째 열은 IceStick의 표준 구성입니다(UART와 LED가 구성되어 있고, 6Kb RAM, 2단계 시프터).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:47.235517Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:58/seg:1",
      "source": "This corresponds to the second line of the Dhrystones test.",
      "source_hash": 15388192995324405621,
      "context_hash": 8937164681307392979,
      "translation": "이는 Dhrystones 테스트의 두 번째 줄에 해당합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:47.235518Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:58/seg:2",
      "source": "Second column measures the impact of the two-level shifter (eats up 40 LUTs).",
      "source_hash": 13977212663338652660,
      "context_hash": 11521408529845231689,
      "translation": "두 번째 열은 2단계 시프터의 영향을 측정합니다(40개의 LUT를 소모합니다).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:47.235518Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:58/seg:3",
      "source": "Third column is a minimalistic configuration, with no peripheral (just LEDs) and minimal RAM, to have an idea of how many LUTs the processor alone uses (less than 1000, achievement unlocked !).",
      "source_hash": 356877599092498180,
      "context_hash": 5180587575277124143,
      "translation": "세 번째 열은 최소한의 구성으로, 주변장치가 없고(LED만 있음) RAM도 최소인 상태에서 프로세서 자체만으로 얼마나 많은 LUT를 사용하는지 파악하기 위한 것입니다(1000개 미만, 업적 달성!).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:47.235519Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:59/seg:0",
      "source": "FemtoRV32 makes a compromise between complexity (the sources fit in 1000 lines of Verilog and - I think - are easy to read), LUT count (1000 is also the magic number here) and performance (around 1000 Dhrystones/s/MHz, most instructions take between 2 and 3 cycles).",
      "source_hash": 14545225592190384801,
      "context_hash": 10971822011938174457,
      "translation": "FemtoRV32는 복잡도(소스가 1000줄의 Verilog 안에 들어가며, 제 생각에는 읽기 쉽습니다), LUT 개수(여기서도 1000이 매직 넘버입니다), 그리고 성능(초당 MHz당 약 1000 Dhrystones, 대부분의 명령어가 2~3 사이클 소요) 사이의 절충을 이루고 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Verilog": "Verilog"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:47.235519Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "FemtoRV32 License",
      "source_hash": 4909040372063921095,
      "context_hash": 11448432721442149858,
      "translation": "FemtoRV32 라이선스",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:47.235520Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "FemtoRV is licensed under the *Three-clause BSD* license:",
      "source_hash": 12167980322829472126,
      "context_hash": 8452065772723500901,
      "translation": "FemtoRV는 *3조항 BSD* 라이선스로 배포됩니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "FemtoRV": "FemtoRV"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:47.235520Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "References to other RISC-V cores",
      "source_hash": 10281149006114817481,
      "context_hash": 7259029481163635040,
      "translation": "다른 RISC-V 코어에 대한 참조",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "RISC-V": "RISC-V"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:08.430153Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The reference: Claire Wolf's [picorv32](https://github.com/cliffordwolf/picorv32) (borrowed many ideas from there).",
      "source_hash": 17573911431752973644,
      "context_hash": 8862975508035113908,
      "translation": "참조: Claire Wolf의 [picorv32](https://github.com/cliffordwolf/picorv32) (여기서 많은 아이디어를 빌려왔습니다).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:08.430154Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "The smallest RISC-V: [SERV](https://github.com/olofk/serv), you can fit 5 instances (!) in 1000 LUTs.",
      "source_hash": 5391781301766496672,
      "context_hash": 3116197721691420521,
      "translation": "가장 작은 RISC-V: [SERV](https://github.com/olofk/serv), 1000개의 LUT에 5개의 인스턴스(!)를 담을 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "RISC-V": "RISC-V"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:08.430154Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Faster cores, Linux capable cores: [biriscv](https://github.com/ultraembedded/biriscv/), [VexRiscv](https://github.com/SpinalHDL/VexRiscv)",
      "source_hash": 6709579148111181571,
      "context_hash": 7446444365535477095,
      "translation": "더 빠른 코어, Linux를 구동할 수 있는 코어: [biriscv](https://github.com/ultraembedded/biriscv/), [VexRiscv](https://github.com/SpinalHDL/VexRiscv)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:08.430154Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "FemtoRV32's best friend: [ICE-V](https://github.com/sylefeb/Silice/tree/master/projects/ice-v), written in [Silice](https://github.com/sylefeb/Silice/) (a higher-level HDL)",
      "source_hash": 13198912108583040986,
      "context_hash": 4291036700072239021,
      "translation": "FemtoRV32의 가장 친한 친구: [ICE-V](https://github.com/sylefeb/Silice/tree/master/projects/ice-v), [Silice](https://github.com/sylefeb/Silice/)(더 고수준의 HDL)로 작성되었습니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:08.430155Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:5/seg:0",
